{"version":1,"key":"article:42","content":{"id":42,"title":"离散傅里叶变换","author":"","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ca36fbc3-f3d9-43e1-b64f-6af9bca67767","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"周期序列的离散傅里叶级数展开"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20a29f79-8a0b-4312-a68f-126fa62588ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正如连续时间周期信号可以表示为一系列正弦信号的和的形式，周期序列也可以表示为一系列正弦之和的形式，假设序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\tilde{x}[n]","collabId":"5897feac-583d-4cab-a42c-2927e111be04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\tilde{x}[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的周期为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"N","collabId":"cfd9e0a6-00a7-45a4-bed0-11a886f4bd85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"N"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么它的基频为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\cfrac{2\\pi}{N}","collabId":"5a8c1eeb-27aa-487d-b5e6-e4794bf6a75d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\cfrac{2\\pi}{N}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以有"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\tilde{x}[n]=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{X}[k]e^{j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}kn}","collabId":"e7d8d5f0-c116-4707-be51-5094d39662fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5c3c635-f02d-4b28-9dd4-d10a77e9443e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里与连续时间信号不同的是，不需要无穷多个成谐波关系的复指数,只需要 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"N","collabId":"7844063b-5945-4ead-82a6-50297e7b577a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"N"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个成谐波关系的复指数。为求傅里叶级数系数 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\tilde{X}[k]","collabId":"dbbecc81-eb97-4b41-84ac-a961aae7d939","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\tilde{X}[k]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，两边同时乘以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"e^{-j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}rn}","collabId":"6721e98a-72de-4c94-bf67-d429e7aebe70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"e^{-j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}rn}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"[0, N-1]","collabId":"e1f052d3-896c-4d1b-8c06-58ce2d420140","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 \\backsim (N-1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 求和"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{x}[n]e^{-j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}rn}=\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{X}[k]\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}e^{j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}(k-r)n}","collabId":"51caffd5-0053-458f-b5cf-3bcad98979fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"788189e6-85c4-4ff1-baae-234ba94e401b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}e^{j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}(k-r)n}=\n\\begin{cases}\n1, \\quad k - r = mN \\\\\n0, \\quad \\text{other}\n\\end{cases}","collabId":"be175929-1c11-4e08-b2d6-e1db8230900e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ceb81308-d7a8-48f9-96cd-40f01aea4f25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代入上式，得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\tilde{X}[r]=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{x}[n]e^{-j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}rn}","collabId":"c1ce5f24-ebf0-425c-9a25-90d8295a6b77","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64798935-d454-4e67-8416-1dde6a7087e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从上看出，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\tilde{X}[r]","collabId":"e25712da-3dc3-425b-a5c6-a89f489050b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\tilde{X}[r]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也是周期序列，周期为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"N","collabId":"3153d2a5-22e1-463a-9573-655bb2c31b99","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"N"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83813941-4907-4603-b78b-3214f39bfbff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总结一下周期序列的展开及其系数的表示"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"{\\tilde{x}[n]=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{X}[k]e^{j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}kn}}","collabId":"70f83621-d190-4619-b66d-fdb1da34477b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"{\\tilde{X}[k]=\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{x}[n]e^{-j\\frac{2\\pi}{N}kn} }","collabId":"fe28a890-ed59-4fb0-ba18-21cac6486ade","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"81fbfc17-fbd5-4c53-ab1a-c485a3979840","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"周期序列的离散时间傅里叶变换"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cd487d3f-3f98-4eaf-87c6-82165dda5467","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将周期信号的傅里叶级数纳入离散时间傅里叶变换（DTFT）的框架是有益的。但是周期序列不是绝对可和的，也不是平方可和的，所以周期序列的 DTFT 应该是冲激串的形式。为导出周期序列的 DTFT 的表达式，不妨先看一下连续周期信号的傅里叶变换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"28cfcf2a-bab0-4cef-8244-08b1e38ecb3c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"连续周期信号可以将其进行傅里叶级数展开"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\tilde{x}(t)=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}F_ne^{jn\\Omega_0 t}","collabId":"57b4f0e6-272d-4598-9b8c-1110f8f89859","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"433e853a-2df9-4f78-a34e-2865a6ae5233","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两边同时进行傅里叶变换"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\tilde{X}(j\\Omega)=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}2\\pi F_n\\delta(\\Omega -n\\Omega_0)","collabId":"663366a4-44f0-4492-aec3-434038387345","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43595922-f38d-4f15-9fad-5b9f50018730","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同理，周期序列的傅里叶变换可以写为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\tilde{X}(e^{jw})=\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{2\\pi}{N}\\tilde{X}[k]\\delta(w-\\frac{2\\pi k}{N})","collabId":"54a570f3-ab93-47c6-aab7-e0600467fc51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9aec40a2-1ce8-41b3-9dd9-98f167374b3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为验证其正确性，对上式进行傅里叶反变换"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{0-\\epsilon}^{2\\pi-\\epsilon}\\tilde{X}(e^{jw})e^{jwn}dw&=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{X}[k]\\int_{0-\\epsilon}^{2\\pi-\\epsilon}\\delta(w-\\frac{2\\pi k}{N})e^{jwn}dw\\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\tilde{X}[k]e^{j\\frac{2\\pi k}{N}n} \\\\\n&=\\tilde{x}[n]\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"082f45dd-571e-4da6-9396-10268e85dcb1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5c86a701-a847-4593-8da5-58802d4d35e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"离散傅里叶变换"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d33515df-6187-4149-b12e-439b799c4739","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们知道，序列进行傅里叶变换得到的频谱都是连续的，而对信号进行数字处理一般都是计算机或者专门的处理器，但无论是计算机还是专门的处理器，其存储精度及存储容量都是有限的，无法处理连续的信号。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"343727b0-c6d0-4b31-9888-2d5d1bf7ed10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们对连续信号进行处理时，是将其进行抽样转换为数字信号，为了无损的恢复出原信号，其抽样速率必须满足奈奎斯特抽样定理。那么可不可以对序列的频谱进行抽样处理呢？为了无损的恢复出原信号，抽样又该满足什么样的条件？假设对于一有限长的信号 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"8587443e-9b7e-436a-824f-5645a5f931ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其长度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"M","collabId":"2f0c9b8e-1278-417e-b196-7ecf926fc3ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"M"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其 DTFT 为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X(e^{jw})","collabId":"dd34755a-faf5-49fb-b7e9-2d825852507f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"X(e^{jw})"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，现对其频谱的主周期进行均匀的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"N","collabId":"313af0ed-9237-4d13-bafa-9255b527fd82","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"N"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 点抽样，得到序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X[k]","collabId":"42c2da32-716b-42e8-bf55-d60a7fc3005a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"X[k]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"X[k]=X(e^{jw})\\vert_{w=\\frac{2\\pi k}{N}}, \\quad k = 0, ... , N-1","collabId":"67889d9b-f496-4884-b821-a2ef41daee2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dae5d324-e299-42cf-a526-debf21b4978a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这与我们之前对傅里叶级数的讨论十分的相似，如果把 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X[k]","collabId":"d99651bc-cd2a-4dd6-b32a-79a5cd4e2560","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"X[k]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 看作是傅里叶级数系数，那么由 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X[k]","collabId":"99dbc2bf-63dd-4965-b5f5-b1dcb08ab9ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"X[k]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 恢复出的信号为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tilde{x}[n]&=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}X[k]e^{j\\frac{2\\pi kn}{N}} \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\sum_{m=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[m]e^{-j\\frac{2\\pi k}{N}m}e^{j\\frac{2\\pi kn}{N}} \\\\\n&=\\sum_{m=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[m](\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}e^{j\\frac{2\\pi k(n-m)}{N}}) \\\\\n&=\\sum_{m=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[m]\\tilde{p}[n-m] \\\\\n&=x[n]*\\tilde{p}[n] \\\\\n&=x[n] * \\sum_{r=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta[n-rN] \\\\\n&=\\sum_{r=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[n-rN]\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"fa60985c-2721-402c-8d8f-9c1d103776b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c25b94e-8f05-4a49-810b-273864d2971f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"恢复出的信号 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\tilde{x}[n]","collabId":"e9afddc3-1048-4a3f-b3e5-46956b78e36c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\tilde{x}[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是原信号以周期 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"N","collabId":"3e2f1976-8c06-4334-a418-4c7e31c8cd8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"N"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行周期延拓得到的结果,如果 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"N\\geq M","collabId":"7f6676d0-9d53-4678-9c37-8219da27c3fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"N\\geq M"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么周期延拓得到的信号没有发生混叠，那么可以取其 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0\\backsim N-1","collabId":"d63c6e1e-38b4-4343-9b17-a6914b1fb496","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0\\backsim N-1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一个周期中前 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"M","collabId":"18a01bbd-97a7-4c03-946f-ef2352fe1487","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"M"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个恢复原来的信号。所以我们可以通过对其频谱进行抽样来处理，并如果满足抽样点数$N$大于等于序列的长度 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"M","collabId":"2e27467f-352b-464c-b6b4-a142ee701a5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"M"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么就可以无损的恢复出原来的信号。这个原则叫做频域抽样定理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"82aadcd8-eac8-4aee-afea-6d0dc195938c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"稍微总结一下上面的过程，我们首先对序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"b907c3f4-76ae-4b13-8b56-833f6a60b50c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行傅里叶变换，然后对其频谱进行抽样得到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X[k]","collabId":"db5d788d-8f95-4776-9ff8-9d76838e6368","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"X[k]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X[k]","collabId":"c57c6df0-dbb6-41b0-adee-e403aa5c162c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"X[k]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为傅里叶级数的系数得到序列 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\tilde{x}[n]","collabId":"e1e858fd-af4f-4a72-8912-90c01b23b6ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\tilde{x}[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果满足频域抽样定理，那么取其主区间的前 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"M","collabId":"df69a103-0a6b-4eca-935f-aedeae889cdd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"M"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个即可恢复出原信号。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d14d1b6d-961b-42b0-a9f7-93578ca92d53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们不妨省略对序列进行傅里叶变换，